  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/1VV9Ti8.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>這是一個<strong>非官方&nbsp;</strong>相容套件，旨在讓&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a>&nbsp;模組的材質與令人驚豔的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/excalibur\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Excalibur</a> 資源包完美融合。</p>\n<p><strong>功能特色：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>以 Excalibur 風格完全重新設計所有方塊、物品與護甲套件的材質</li>\n<li>3D 模型</li>\n<li>自訂附魔書籍（需 CIT 支援）</li>\n<li>自訂傳送門（需 CTM 支援）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>為了獲得最佳體驗，建議搭配 Excalibur 資源包一起使用。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/Na20R3k.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/BfmsrJl.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iw5PPZ3.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/PsmZeXk.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ymT9bIq.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>鳴謝：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Maffhew - Excalibur</li>\n<li>KyaniteMods - Deeper and Darker</li>\n</ul>",
